\begin_inset Formula $\varrho_{ij,k}\equiv\left(1+\mu_{k}\right)\tau_{ij,k}\bar{a}_{i,k}^{\frac{1}{1+\mu_{k}}}\left(\mu_{k}/f_{k}^{e}\right)^{\frac{-\mu_{k}}{1+\mu_{k}}}$
