\begin_inset Formula $\textbf{w}\equiv\{\grave{w}{}_{i}\}$
\end_inset

 to denote the global vector of wages.
 We also assume throughout the paper that the underlying parameters of the
 model are such that the necessary and sufficient conditions for the uniqueness
 of equilibrium are satisfied.
