\begin_inset Formula $\mathcal{L}_{i}=\mathbb{E}_{\rho_{i}}\left[\mu\log\mu\right]-\mathbb{E}_{\rho_{i}}\left[\mu\right]\log\mathbb{E}_{\rho_{i}}\left[\mu\right],$
\end_inset

 where 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathbb{E}_{\rho_{i}}\left[\mu\right]$
\end_inset

