\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
The first stage involves a 
\emph on
shallow agreement
\emph default
 that disciplines non-cooperative trade taxes helping countries avert a
 full-fledged trade war.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
The second stage involves a 
\emph on
deep agreement
\emph default
